@startuml Media Player

hide empty description

[*] --> Stopped

Stopped --> Playing : can_play / start_playback

Playing --> Paused : should_pause / pause_playback
Paused --> Playing : should_resume / resume_playback

Playing --> Stopped : should_stop / stop_playback
Paused --> Stopped : should_stop / stop_playback

Playing --> Buffering : buffer_empty / start_buffering
Buffering --> Playing : buffer_ready / resume_playback

Playing --> Error : has_error / handle_error
Paused --> Error : has_error / handle_error
Buffering --> Error : has_error / handle_error

Error --> Stopped : should_reset / reset

@enduml